message.reasoning:
我们需要回答用户：作为软件供应链安全分析员，根据漏洞库记录和网页搜索结果，为具体漏洞写“漏洞卡”。只输出一个 JSON 对象，字段：vulnerable_symbols, trigger, preconditions, exploit_evidence, fixed_version, summary_zh。

需要分析材料。包 npm/axios 1.7.4，漏洞 CVE-2026-42039。漏洞库记录说明 toFormData 无界递归，深度嵌套请求数据导致 RangeError DoS。toFormData 是 FormData 请求体和 AxiosURLSearchParams 的序列化器，buildURL 在 params 是对象且 URLSearchParams 不可用时使用。任何服务端代码将客户端对象转发到 axios({ data, params }) 会到达递归 walker。PoC 直接 import toFormData 并调用 toFormData(nest(2500), new FormData())。还有 server-side reachability: app.post('/forward', async (req,res)=> await axios.post('https://upstream/api', req.body); res.send('ok')).

需要确定 vulnerable_symbols：应用代码要调用哪些 API 才会把外部输入送进漏洞。注意写“应用代码调用的入口”，而不只是攻击载荷里出现的函数；若漏洞在包的通用路径上、任何使用都可能触发，返回 []。这里应用代码入口是 axios 请求调用，例如 axios.post / axios.request / axios.get? 具体触发路径：
- 当请求 data 是对象且会被序列化为 FormData？axios 默认 data 对象会 JSON 序列化，不一定 toFormData。toFormData 用于 FormData request bodies 和 AxiosURLSearchParams。Axios 中如果 data 是 FormData 实例？toFormData 可能用于转换对象到 FormData？需要看 axios 1.7.4 行为。漏洞描述说 toFormData is serializer behind FormData request bodies and AxiosURLSearchParams (used by buildURL when params is an object with URLSearchParams unavailable). 所以入口可以是 axios 请求调用，且 data 为对象/FormData? 或 params 为对象且 URLSearchParams unavailable。应用代码调用 axios.post(url, data) 或 axios.get(url, {params})。更准确 vulnerable_symbols 应该列应用代码调用的入口 API，如 "axios.post"、"axios.get"、"axios.request"、"axios"。但字段要求“应用代码要调用哪些 API 才会把外部输入送进漏洞（如 "_.template"、"yaml.load"、"Logger.info"）”。这里应用代码调用 axios 实例方法或默认导出。可以写 ["axios", "axios.post", "axios.get", "axios.request"]? 需要谨慎。漏洞在包的通用路径上？不是任何使用都可能触发，只有 data/params 深度嵌套且走 toFormData。所以不是 []。

vulnerable_symbols 可能应该包括 "axios.post" 和 "axios.get" 或 "axios.request"。因为 server-side reachability example 用 axios.post。buildURL 用于 params，任何请求方法带 params 都可能。data 为 FormData 或对象？axios 的 toFormData 在 transformRequest 中用于将对象转换为 FormData 当 responseType? 实际上 axios 1.x: if data is object and not FormData, default transformRequest JSON.stringify unless headers content-type multipart/form-data? There is toFormData used when data is object and headers content-type multipart/form-data? Let's recall axios 1.7.4 source. lib/defaults/index.js transformRequest: if utils.isFormData(data) ... if utils.isObject(data) ... if headers content-type multipart/form-data? It may use toFormData? In axios 1.x, toFormData is used in AxiosURLSearchParams and in transformRequest for object data when content-type is multipart/form-data? Let's inspect memory: axios/lib/defaults/index.js:
transformRequest: [function transformRequest(data, headers) {
  const contentType = headers.getContentType() || '';
  const hasJSONContentType = contentType.indexOf('application/json') > -1;
  const isObjectPayload = utils.isObject(data);
  if (isObjectPayload && utils.isHTMLForm(data)) data = new FormData(data);
  if (utils.isFormData(data)) {
    if (!hasJSONContentType) return data;
    return hasJSONContentType ? JSON.stringify(formDataToJSON(data)) : data;
  }
  if (utils.isArrayBuffer(data)) return data;
  ...
  if (utils.isURLSearchParams(data)) { ... }
  if (isObjectPayload) {
    if (contentType.indexOf('application/x-www-form-urlencoded') > -1) {
      return toURLEncodedForm(data).toString();
    }
    if (hasJSONContentType || isObjectPayload) {
      return JSON.stringify(data);
    }
  }
  return data;
}]
Maybe toFormData not in default transformRequest? In axios 1.7, there is toFormData used in AxiosURLSearchParams and maybe in transformRequest for multipart? Let's recall: lib/helpers/toFormData.js exports toFormData. It is used in lib/defaults/index.js? Search memory: In axios 1.7.4, defaults transformRequest includes:
if (utils.isObject(data) || (contentType.indexOf('application/x-www-form-urlencoded') > -1)) {
  return toURLEncodedForm(data).toString();
}
if (hasJSONContentType || isObjectPayload) {
  return JSON.stringify(data);
}
No toFormData? But there is AxiosURLSearchParams uses toFormData? Actually AxiosURLSearchParams constructor: this._pairs = []; toFormData? Let's recall lib/helpers/AxiosURLSearchParams.js:
import toFormData from './toFormData.js';
export default class AxiosURLSearchParams {
  constructor(params, options) {
    this._pairs = [];
    params && toFormData(params, this, options);
  }
  ...
}
And buildURL: if utils.isURLSearchParams(params) return params.toString(); if (utils.isObject(params)) { if (options && options.serializeURLSearchParams) return options.serializeURLSearchParams(params); return new AxiosURLSearchParams(params, options).toString(); }
So params object triggers toFormData via AxiosURLSearchParams. Also if data is FormData? toFormData may be used to convert object to FormData when content-type multipart? Maybe in transformRequest: if (utils.isObject(data) && contentType.indexOf('multipart/form-data') > -1) { const _FormData = env.FormData; data = new toFormData(data, new _FormData(), {visitor: ...}).toJSON()? } Not sure. But vulnerability description says serializer behind FormData request bodies and AxiosURLSearchParams. So both data as FormData? Actually toFormData can serialize object into FormData. If user passes object as data with content-type multipart/form-data, axios may convert to FormData using toFormData. Need not over-specify.

vulnerable_symbols: likely ["axios.post", "axios.get", "axios.request", "axios"]? The field examples are API names. Could include "axios" as default export function. But if we list too many, okay? Need precise. The application code entry that sends external input into vulnerability: any axios request call where attacker-controlled object is passed as data or params. So "axios.post" and "axios.get" and "axios.request" are entry points. Maybe "axios.create" returns instance, but not direct. We can list ["axios", "axios.post", "axios.get", "axios.request"]. But "axios" is the default export callable. In code, axios.post is common. If they use instance = axios.create(); instance.post, then entry is instance.post. But vulnerable_symbols likely should be package APIs: "axios.post", "axios.get", "axios.request". Could include "axios" to cover default call.

preconditions: 除调用入口 API 之外还必须同时成立的前提列表。需要：
- 外部输入对象/参数深度嵌套（约 2000+ 层）且被传入 axios 请求的 data 或 params。
- 请求路径会调用 toFormData：data 被序列化为 FormData（例如 multipart/form-data 或 FormData 请求体）或 params 为对象且使用 AxiosURLSearchParams（URLSearchParams 不可用/自定义 serialize?）。
- 运行在 Node.js 环境？漏洞说 crashes Node.js process; browsers maybe RangeError but not process crash. DoS in Node. Could precondition: Node.js 服务端处理请求，且异常未被捕获/进程未隔离。 But trigger already says deeply nested request data. Preconditions should be additional to calling entry API. Need list:
  - "请求的 data 或 params 为攻击者可控的深层嵌套对象（约 2000+ 层）" maybe trigger covers input. But preconditions can include "data/params 会进入 toFormData 序列化路径（FormData 请求体或 URLSearchParams 参数序列化）".
  - "运行在 Node.js 且未捕获 RangeError/未做深度限制，导致进程或请求崩溃". Is that a precondition? The vulnerability is unbounded recursion; RangeError thrown synchronously. In typical Express handler terminates request; in synchronous startup/worker can crash process. For DoS, need process crash? If request handler catches? If uncaught, request fails. But DoS maybe request termination enough. The description says crashes Node.js process with RangeError. Actually RangeError escapes axios request call; in typical Express/Fastify request handlers this terminates the running request; in synchronous startup paths or worker threads it can crash whole process. So precondition for process crash: uncaught exception in synchronous path/worker. But for DoS, request termination may be enough. We can include "异常未被捕获或运行在会因未捕获 RangeError 终止请求/进程的路径". But maybe too specific.

